{
  "description": "Propositional logic lab organism — toggle atomic proposition truth values and watch compound formulas evaluate live on a truth table, apply inference rules (modus ponens, modus tollens) step by step in a guided proof, test syllogisms on a Venn diagram, propagate values through a boolean circuit, classify arguments as valid or fallacious, or evaluate quantified statements against a finite model, composed from the std-logic-truthtable, std-logic-inference, std-logic-venn, std-logic-gates, std-logic-fallacy, and std-logic-quantifier instrument atoms behind a mode router.",
