              "synonyms": "logic, boolean logic, propositional logic, truth table, truth value, proposition, atomic proposition, logical connective, conjunction, disjunction, negation, material implication, logical implication, AND gate, OR gate, NOT gate, inference rule, modus ponens, modus tollens, syllogism, logical deduction, logical proof, premise, logical argument, tautology, contradiction, logical equivalence, venn diagram, categorical syllogism, mood, figure, existential import, boolean circuit, digital logic, XOR gate, logic gate, fallacy, informal fallacy, ad hominem, straw man, false dilemma, affirming the consequent, valid argument, quantifier, predicate logic, universal quantifier, existential quantifier, for all, there exists, model, domain of discourse",
